      "description": "Bagging the laid-up part for cure: release peel ply, release film and breather over the tool (their laying rates), unrolling the bag (vacuumBagMaterialUnrollRate), taping its sealant round the tool (applyVacuumBagRate, sealantTapeLengthMultiplier) and its vacuum port.",
